# Test Cases — DonateNow v2.0

> Version: 2.0 — Multi-Cause Donation Platform
> Reference: [PRD.mdc](../Context/PRD.mdc) | [KPI.mdc](../Context/KPI.mdc) | [TDD_Strategy.mdc](./TDD_Strategy.mdc)

---

## Test Case Format

| Field | Description |
|---|---|
| **Test ID** | Unique identifier (TC-2-NNN) |
| **Feature** | Feature being tested (F2-XX) |
| **Scenario** | What is being tested |
| **Preconditions** | Required state before test |
| **Steps** | Test execution steps |
| **Expected Result** | What should happen |
| **Test Type** | Unit / Integration / UI |
| **KPIs** | Associated KPI(s) |

